#: {{ux|en|the '''cup''' of an acorn}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1745|author=w:William Shenstone|title=Elegy VIII
|passage=The cowslip's golden '''cup''' no more I see.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2003|author=Garrett Hack|title=The Handplane Book|page=143
|passage=Even if the parts are thicknessed by machine, check for and plane out any '''cup''' with a bench plane.}}
